# Planned work and constraints
Plan a sequence for two requested changes, without editing or Git operations.
A. Rename exported loadItem to fetchItem across a package and all consumers. The old name can be
removed in this source-only repository; there are no independently deployed consumers. Export and
callers must change together or the intermediate build fails. Tests and docs refer to this API.
B. Repair a logging redaction bug in an unrelated module, with its own regression test.
An existing patch also reformats a third module that neither change touches. Reformatting was not
requested. An engineer proposes frontend / backend / tests / docs commits and one PR per file.
Assess actual purpose boundaries and dependencies, then suggest a usable sequence and PR grouping
only if justified for submission. Do not add compatibility shims merely to split the rename.
